category: Security
requires: cygwin-devel libopus-devel libtoxav2 libtoxcore-devel libvpx-devel pkg-config
sdesc: "The future of online communications (development / AV)"
ldesc: "With the rise of governmental monitoring programs, Tox, a FOSS initiative,
aims to be an easy to use, all-in-one communication platform that ensures
their users full privacy and secure message delivery."
external-source: toxcore

